Yep; that's what it does now - although it never did it before it went 
into storage, and it only did it that one time when it was powered up 
from cold. Also, with the printhead at the LHS of the carriage at start 
up, it normally jumps about 1/2" to the left, before returning to its 
normal position; a couple of times, it has moved only a tiny amount to 
the left, before returning... odd.

Your advice seems to work, BTW - thanks!

> >Anyway, I managed to locate another knackered LA120 logic board that I'd 
