In article <72b4qh$b9g$1@news.mel.aone.net.au>, "Geoff Roberts" <geoffrobx@stmarksx.ppx.catholicx.edux.aux> writes:
|>Antonio Carlini wrote in message <728toi$auj$1@nntpd.lkg.dec.com>...
|>
|>>But short of the (somewhat rare) VAXstation 8000
|>
|>Probably more than somewhat rare.  Never heard of it before now.
|>Can you tell us any more about it?
