  To switch between the ARC (or AlphaBIOS) and the SRM console firmware:

    ftp://ftp.digital.com/pub/DEC/Alpha/firmware/utilities/mkboot.txt
    ftp://ftp.digital.com/pub/DEC/Alpha/firmware/utilities/mkbootarc.txt
    ftp://ftp.digital.com/pub/DEC/Alpha/firmware/utilities/mkntboot.txt

  The above documents are useful when working with a half-flash system
  such as the AlphaStation 255, and switching between the Windows NT
  (ARC or AlphaBIOS) and the OpenVMS or UNIX (SRM) operating system
  firmware environments.

  I posted information on the failsafe firmware loader a while back, 
